{"name":"Hush","hex":"#c4bdba","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hush","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become quiet.","To make quiet."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A silence, especially after some noise."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hush (1921 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Hush is a 1921 American silent drama film directed by Harry Garson and starring Clara Kimball Young, J. Frank Glendon and Kathlyn Williams."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/A_scene_from_%22Hush%22_%28SAYRE_13912%29.jpg/330px-A_scene_from_%22Hush%22_%28SAYRE_13912%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hush_(1921_film)","wikidata":"Q66501564"},{"title":"Hush (1998 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Hush is a 1998 American thriller film starring Jessica Lange, Gwyneth Paltrow and Johnathon Schaech. The film was directed by Jonathan Darby and written by Darby and Helen Whitfield. The plot follows newlyweds Helen and Jackson Baring, who move to the family thoroughbred horse ranch to support Jackson's mother, Martha, during Helen's pregnancy. However, Martha's hostile behaviour towards Helen soon raises suspicions."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/60/Hushposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hush_(1998_film)","wikidata":"Q162759"},{"title":"Hush (2016 feature film)","blocks":[{"text":"Hush is a 2016 American slasher film directed and edited by Mike Flanagan, and starring Kate Siegel, who also co-wrote the film with Flanagan. The film co-stars John Gallagher Jr., Michael Trucco, Samantha Sloyan, and Emilia \"Emma\" Graves. It was jointly produced by Trevor Macy through Intrepid Pictures and Jason Blum through Blumhouse Productions."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e3/Hush_2016_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hush_(2016_feature_film)","wikidata":"Q23044927"},{"title":"Hush (character)","blocks":[{"text":"Hush is a supervillain appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics. Created by Jeph Loeb and Jim Lee, the character first appeared in Batman #609 in January 2003 as part of the twelve-issue storyline Batman: Hush. Hush's background is parallel to the superhero Batman, and he serves as a criminal foil to him, as an example of what Batman could have become if he had an abusive family and used his abilities and resources for malice. He belongs to the collective of adversaries that make up Batman's rogues' gallery."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/90/Hush_%28Thomas_%27Tommy%27_Elliot%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hush_(character)","wikidata":"Q2282627"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/3a/BatmanGothamKnights60.jpg/250px-BatmanGothamKnights60.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3a/BatmanGothamKnights60.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/3a/BatmanGothamKnights60.jpg/250px-BatmanGothamKnights60.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Hush returns. Cover to Batman: Gotham Knights #60 (December 2004). Pencils by Jae Lee.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABatmanGothamKnights60.jpg"}],"sounds":{"hush":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-AcpoKrane-hush.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons